{"product_id":"smok-acro-25w-pod-system-kit","title":"SMOK ACRO 25W Pod System Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the \u003cem\u003eSMOK ACRO 25W Pod System\u003c\/em\u003e, featuring a 5-25W output range, integrated 1000mAh battery, and uses two firing systems to produce vapor. Constructed from zinc-alloy, the chassis is durable and is resistant to light falls and drops. Offering a dual firing system, the \u003cem\u003eSMOK ACRO\u003c\/em\u003e can be activated off a draw or button firing operation, producing exquisite vapor from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salt stored in the 2mL integrated coil pod. Displaying information on an 0.69\" OLED display screen, the wattage is adjustable between 5-25W. Equipped with a 1000mAh rechargeable battery, the ACRO is rechargeable via bottom Type-C USB Port, rapidly restoring the battery for use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-acro-replacement-pods\" title=\"SMOK ACRO Replacement Pods\"\u003eSMOK ACRO Replacement Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0480\/2061\/9416\/files\/SMOK_Acro_infographic.jpg?v=1633046545\" alt=\"smok acro pod system infographic\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK ACRO 25W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 103mm by 30.2mm by 11.2mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1000mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 5-25W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 1.5-4.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.6-2.5ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Firing System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntui